  "description": "Follows the Hero Twins’ contest with the lords of Xibalba, their trials, transformations and reversal of the earlier generation’s defeat. Traces the making of maize people, limited human vision, fire, migrations and K’iche’ lineage claims, examining information, rigged contests, reciprocal obligations and the colonial manuscript’s relationship to a living Indigenous tradition.",
